      "source_url": "https://thaqalayn.net/hadith/34/1/164/167",
      "text": [
        "ه عن أبي ولّاد الحنّاط فقد رويته عن أبي- رضي اللّه عنه- عن سعد بن عبد اللّه، عن الهيثم بن أبي مسروق النهديّ، عن الحسن بن محبوب، عن أبي ولّاد الحنّاط، و اسمه حفص بن سالم مولى بني مخزوم‌."
      ],
      "translations": {
        "en.bab-ul-qaim-publications": [
          "Everything in this book that is narrated from Abu Wallad Al-Hannat has been transmitted by me from my father - may Allah (swt) be pleased with him - from Sa'd ibn Abdullah, from Al-Haytham ibn Abi Masruq Al-Nahdi, from Al-Hasan ibn Mahbub, from Abu Wallad Al-Hannat, whose name was Hafs ibn Salim, a freed servant (mawla) of Banu Makhzum."
        ]
      }
